## Proposed Changes

### 1. Backend Go Layer (Docker Integration & Services)

#### [MODIFY] [`apps/backend/go.mod`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/go.mod)
- Menambahkan dependensi resmi Docker Go SDK:
  - `github.com/docker/docker v27.1.1+incompatible`
  - `github.com/docker/go-connections`
  - `github.com/opencontainers/image-spec`

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/model/docker.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/model/docker.go)
- Struct model internal untuk Docker:
  - `ContainerSummary`: ID, Names, Image, State, Status, Created, Ports, Labels.
  - `ContainerDetail`: ID, Name, Image, State, Status, Created, RestartCount, Platform, Mounts, NetworkSettings, Config (Env sanitized).
  - `ContainerStats`: CPUPercentage, MemoryUsageBytes, MemoryLimitBytes, MemoryPercentage, NetworkRxBytes, NetworkTxBytes, BlockReadBytes, BlockWriteBytes, PidsCurrent.
  - `DockerSystemInfo`: ContainersTotal, ContainersRunning, ContainersPaused, ContainersStopped, ImagesTotal, NCPU, TotalMemory, Driver, DockerVersion, KernelVersion, OperatingSystem.
  - `DockerImageInfo`: ID, RepoTags, Size, Created.
  - `DockerVolumeInfo`: Name, Driver, Scope, Mountpoint, Size.
  - `DockerNetworkInfo`: ID, Name, Driver, Scope, Subnet, Gateway.

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/integration/docker_client.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/integration/docker_client.go)
- Wrapper klien Docker Engine:
  - Inisialisasi otomatis via `client.NewClientWithOpts(client.FromEnv, client.WithAPIVersionNegotiation())` (kompatibel lintas platform Windows named pipe dan Linux Unix socket).
  - Metode lengkap:
    - `ListContainers(ctx, all bool)`
    - `GetContainer(ctx, id string)`
    - `GetContainerStats(ctx, id string)`
    - `GetContainerLogs(ctx, id string, tail int)`
    - `RestartContainer(ctx, id string)`
    - `StopContainer(ctx, id string)`
    - `ListImages(ctx)`
    - `ListVolumes(ctx)`
    - `ListNetworks(ctx)`
    - `GetSystemInfo(ctx)`
  - Error wrapping konsisten ke `apperror`.

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/service/docker_service.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/service/docker_service.go)
- Business service layer Docker:
  - Transformasi raw Docker SDK types ke `model.ContainerSummary`, `model.ContainerStats`, dll.
  - Agregasi statistik: total, running, paused, stopped containers.
  - Caching Redis 60 detik untuk images dan volumes (`cifo:docker:images`, `cifo:docker:volumes`).
  - Audit logging terintegrasi via `auditRepo.Create()` untuk aksi restart dan stop.

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/service/monitoring_service.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/service/monitoring_service.go)
- Layanan agregasi telemetri dashboard:
  - `GetDashboardStats(ctx)`: Menghitung metrik Tier 1 nyata (Total Containers, Running, Stopped, Overall RAM % dari Host System Info, Active Incidents).
  - `GetTimeSeriesMetrics(ctx, metricType, timeRange)`: Mengambil data deret waktu CPU/RAM dari host & container.

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/handler/docker_handler.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/handler/docker_handler.go)
- Handler HTTP Echo v4:
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/containers` (query: `status=running|stopped|all`)
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/containers/:id`
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/containers/:id/stats`
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/containers/:id/logs` (query: `tail=200`)
  - `POST /api/v1/docker/containers/:id/restart` (Role: `devops` | `admin`)
  - `POST /api/v1/docker/containers/:id/stop` (Role: `admin`)
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/images`
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/volumes`
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/networks`
  - `GET /api/v1/docker/system`

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/handler/monitoring_handler.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/handler/monitoring_handler.go)
- Handler HTTP Echo v4:
  - `GET /api/v1/monitoring/stats` (Agregat KPI Tier 1)
  - `GET /api/v1/monitoring/metrics/cpu` (Time-series CPU)
  - `GET /api/v1/monitoring/metrics/memory` (Time-series RAM)
  - `GET /api/v1/monitoring/metrics/network` (Time-series Network)

#### [MODIFY] [`apps/backend/cmd/server/main.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/cmd/server/main.go)
- Mendaftarkan rute Docker dan Monitoring ke grup `/api/v1` dengan proteksi `RequireAuth` dan `RequireRole`.

